  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Freezing point depression refers to the lowering of the freezing point of solvent&nbsp;upon the addition of solute.&nbsp;<em>Boiling point elevation</em>&nbsp;refers to the increase in the&nbsp;<em>boiling point</em>&nbsp;of a solvent upon the addition of a solute.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>iK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>iK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>iK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>iK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math><br /><br />Dividing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi>ii</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
